        "content": "{\"reviews\":[{\"review_id\":\"2d8b667b-8006-4df6-a46d-8bc7860a370b\",\"review_text\":\"Thinking of moving to YT music as it keeps forcing joe rogan into my suggestions. I'M NOT INTERESTED. Oh and i pay for premium. Let me block him please.\"},{\"review_id\":\"81a8e785-01ff-42e5-bcc5-827da748ccdf\",\"review_text\":\"I hate this app very much because it is only the waste of time.\"},{\"review_id\":\"6b780718-36cc-4102-817f-adef167df50e\",\"review_text\":\"I love it 💗\"},{\"review_id\":\"5b09ce82-4b48-4e47-97fa-24c4684b8947\",\"review_text\":\"The new update is sucks like why you changed that we can choose the song to play??? Shuffle play is bad please remove this\"},{\"review_id\":\"2d0c9df8-5d4b-4617-9b74-fcf920ae10d2\",\"review_text\":\"Its great 👍\"},{\"review_id\":\"a019b4a6-8a12-4a49-917b-6b0992737759\",\"review_text\":\"Overally good\"},{\"review_id\":\"7312d5d7-c9a2-41ab-a7fc-d192368acabe\",\"review_text\":\"I hate this app cause I thought premium only for no add so I was unlikeing all song and I want to search back to like so when this song finished the other one will play so I was searching and when I click the song the song name is the same but the song different and then I just now we need premium to hear song freely\"},{\"review_id\":\"06793f31-33a0-4b79-a93e-b0ffb46d311d\",\"review_text\":\"I can't use this in Macau and Indonesia so where I can use it?????? I use this APK 2years in Singapore why when I go to Indonesia and Macau I can't use it again?????? Damnit!!!!!!!!\"},{\"review_id\":\"d1f096de-97c1-451b-9e62-b1d0c2bc39b6\",\"review_text\":\"Worst experience\"},{\"review_id\":\"7499ac85-1a91-4c04-99ce-86adbb6247b1\",\"review_text\":\"Racist\"}]}"
